# Rendered audio — regenerate from lyrics.txt + parameters.md via Google Flow
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.flac
*.ogg

# Raw Claude session logs.
#
# These are the provenance of every song — the proof each one came from a
# bare, unsteered session — and it is a real loss to leave them out. They are
# excluded anyway because a session log is an uncontrolled capture surface:
# some of these are full Claude Code sessions (one is 2400+ lines with 400+
# tool calls) containing arbitrary file contents, absolute paths, and machine
# state from unrelated work. Nothing sensitive was found in them, but "nothing
# was found" is not the same as "nothing is there", and that guarantee is not
# one a grep can make for a public repo.
#
# A sanitized export — the child's prompt and reply only, stripped of cwd,
# uuids, and identifiers — would restore the provenance safely. Until then:
session.jsonl
